ipp-usb-assistant (1.0.0+uos) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UOS 20 (Qt5 / DTK5) build:
    - Build-Depends / Depends pinned to Qt5 and Dtk5 -dev packages.
    - debhelper-compat lowered to 12 for UOS 20 (Debian 10 based).
  * Driverless printing and scanning manager:
    - IPP-USB environment detection with service control and one-click repair.
    - Driverless printer discovery, queue management and PPD fine-tuning.
    - SANE/eSCL scanning with embedded preview and scan-source labelling.
    - Advanced per-device filtering (keep driverless print, release scan).

